EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ahhh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0024:}}I know, I know,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
you're wishing I'd head to your
house here soon, right?
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I'm sorry, but something's suddenly
come up and I can't go!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I promise I'll make it up to you, so{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
invite me over again sometime,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Aah,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0024:}}Biliyorum, biliyorum,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
birazdan evine gelmemi bekliyorsun, değil mi?
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Üzgünüm ama birden bir iş çıktı ve
gelemeyeceğim!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Telafi edeceğime söz veriyorum,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
o yüzden beni yine bir ara davet et,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0007:}}Was war denn los?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Wir sind zu deinem Haus gelaufen,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
und plötzlich warst du einfach weg!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Haben dich Außerirdische entführt?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Oder bist du am Ende ein Ninja?
